t the inventory alone.\n75|- `isWTF8SurrogateAt` punch-out (`raw[index+1] != 0xa1`, admitting 64 of 2048\n76|  encodings): survives the package — recorded as the single stated bound, with\n77|  the production predicate separately swept over all 2048 encodings\n78|  (missed = 0/2048) and the branch proven production-dead (disabling it moves\n79|  only the white-box pin; leaf2 M81 killing the covering `utf8.Valid` arm).\n80|- Surrogate agreement: disabling `isWTF8SurrogateAt` reddens\n81|  `TestSurrogateGateAgreesWithCanonicalJSON` with 6 agreement failures.\n82|\n83|Full per-mutant tables: `TASK-260830-1snnef_review6-mutation-results.json`\n84|(277 rows). Survivor bounds: C45 (disclosed unbounded-domain), S10\n85|(equivalent), B5 (intended-GREEN ordering control), J1 (receiver-ident\n86|match on import-aliased errors)."}}}
